<title>GREECE: DEPUTY HEALTH MIN PAPADELIS SUFFERS SEVERE STROKE.</title>
<headline>DEPUTY HEALTH MIN PAPADELIS SUFFERS SEVERE STROKE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek Deputy Health Minister Fragiskos Papadelis suffered a stroke in the island of Limnos last night and was taken to the state General Hospital in Athens in a serious condition, radios and TV stations said.</p>
<p>Prime Minister Costas Simitis visited Papdelis at the hospital. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
